[statement]
As `a-choice-reached-only-through-the-package-it-favors-steers-nothing`,
for a name some package carries: `app` needs `h`, whose best candidate
is `h` 5; `h` 1 needs `dav`, whose one candidate needs `h=1`. `dav` is
reached only through `h` 1, and apk installs `h` 5.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:h

P:h
V:5

P:h
V:1
D:dav

P:dav
V:7
D:h=1

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install h 5
install app 1
